Package: libscintilla-gtk4-bugaevc-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends:
 libscintilla-gtk4-bugaevc-5 (= ${binary:Version}),
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: ScintillaWidget - bugaevc GTK4 fork of Scintilla (development)
 The ScintillaWidget control is a GTK4 port of the Scintilla text
 editor widget, from the bugaevc fork of Scintilla.
 .
 This package contains the development files: headers, pkg-config
 metadata, and the unversioned shared library symlink.
